# MODULE restricted Android native guest backend
# PURPOSE emit real AArch64 context result and log sink execution
# INPUT eight raw dot offset bytes then admitted normalized arithmetic and final dot
# OUTPUT position independent guest code at hexadecimal one thousand
# ADDRESS log function slot at hexadecimal one million
# TAPE zero command one plus flag two residue three minus flag
# TAPE four byte printer five literal scratch eight through fifteen raw dot offset
# TAPE sixteen and seventeen command count eighteen through twenty count scratch
# REQUIREMENT caller validates complete source subset offset ledger and physical closure
# REQUIREMENT source count at most sixty five thousand five hundred thirty five
# LIMITATION backend component no source admission ELF callback or platform loader
# ABI mapped aligned live caller pointers context forty result fifty six
# FRAME ninety six bytes preserves native callee state and invocation local buffers

# Retain original dot offset and select byte printer
